WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.974 --> 00:00:09.011
The Piano Roll is where you write melodies. First pick a channel, here the Keys.

2
00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:14.563
Choose a scale and its notes light up, so you stay in key. Snap keeps notes on the grid.

3
00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:20.435
Click to draw a note. Drag its end to stretch it, and new notes keep that length.

4
00:00:26.978 --> 00:00:33.108
Stuck? Click Generate, or press Alt G. Pick Chords and you get four variations.

5
00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:38.577
Click one to apply it. It's a single undo step.

6
00:00:39.028 --> 00:00:41.164
Press play to hear it with the beat.

7
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:49.921
And Scripts, the braces button, runs your own note tools in JavaScript.
